{'symbol': 'TPR', 'date': '2021-08-31 06:45:00', 'title': 'JOHANNA W. (HANNEKE) FABER JOINS TAPESTRY, INC. BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TAPESTRY, INC. (NYSE: TPR), A LEADING NEW YORK-BASED HOUSE OF MODERN LUXURY ACCESSORIES AND LIFESTYLE BRANDS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT HANNEKE FABER HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO TAPESTRY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS. THE APPOINTMENT OF MS. FABER TO THE BOARD BRINGS THE MEMBERSHIP TO ELEVEN, INCLUDING TEN INDEPENDENT DIRECTORS. MS. FABER CURRENTLY SERVES AS PRESIDENT, GLOBAL FOODS AND REFRESHMENT AT UNILEVER PLC. SHE HAS NEARLY 30 YEARS EXPERIENCE IN CONSUMER GOODS AND RETAIL, HAVING ALS"}